{"id":"forecast-16","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-16/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":419.79,"segments":[{"start":1.62,"end":9.02,"text":"Part 3. You will hear a conversation between an art history student called Terence and his","words":[["Part",1.62,2.14],["3.",2.14,2.6],["You",3.72,4.08],["will",4.08,4.24],["hear",4.24,4.44],["a",4.44,4.62],["conversation",4.62,5.3],["between",5.3,5.8],["an",5.8,6.04],["art",6.04,6.32],["history",6.32,6.64],["student",6.64,7.2],["called",7.2,7.64],["Terence",7.64,8.12],["and",8.12,8.84],["his",8.84,9.02]]},{"start":9.02,"end":12.54,"text":"tutor about the student's plan for a class presentation.","words":[["tutor",9.02,9.32],["about",9.32,9.9],["the",9.9,10.14],["student's",10.14,10.72],["plan",10.72,11.0],["for",11.0,11.32],["a",11.32,11.52],["class",11.52,11.78],["presentation.",11.78,12.54]]},{"start":13.92,"end":50.84,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 21 to 24. Now listen carefully and answer","words":[["First",13.92,14.68],["you",14.68,14.92],["have",14.92,15.08],["some",15.08,15.28],["time",15.28,15.7],["to",15.7,15.94],["look",15.94,16.08],["at",16.08,16.22],["questions",16.22,16.54],["21",16.54,17.38],["to",17.38,17.68],["24.",17.68,18.26],["Now",48.92,49.22],["listen",49.22,49.58],["carefully",49.58,50.06],["and",50.06,50.42],["answer",50.42,50.84]]},{"start":50.84,"end":53.06,"text":"questions 21 to 24.","words":[["questions",50.84,51.22],["21",51.22,52.18],["to",52.18,52.44],["24.",52.44,53.06]]},{"start":56.65,"end":63.83,"text":"Okay Terence, now I've looked through your preliminary outline and notes for the presentation","words":[["Okay",56.65,57.17],["Terence,",57.17,57.99],["now",58.41,58.75],["I've",58.75,59.33],["looked",59.33,59.51],["through",59.51,59.81],["your",59.81,60.01],["preliminary",60.01,60.57],["outline",60.57,61.39],["and",61.39,62.11],["notes",62.11,62.53],["for",62.53,62.79],["the",62.79,62.91],["presentation",62.91,63.83]]},{"start":63.83,"end":67.15,"text":"on the art of the Efe region in Africa.","words":[["on",63.83,64.63],["the",64.63,64.91],["art",64.91,65.23],["of",65.23,65.43],["the",65.43,65.55],["Efe",65.55,65.99],["region",65.99,66.49],["in",66.49,66.69],["Africa.",66.69,67.15]]},{"start":67.75,"end":69.31,"text":"That's in Nigeria, right?","words":[["That's",67.75,68.23],["in",68.23,68.37],["Nigeria,",68.37,68.85],["right?",68.87,69.31]]},{"start":69.67,"end":75.51,"text":"Yes. I'm concentrating on Efe sculptures from the 12th to the 15th century.","words":[["Yes.",69.67,69.93],["I'm",70.61,70.93],["concentrating",70.93,71.47],["on",71.47,71.93],["Efe",71.93,72.29],["sculptures",72.29,72.65],["from",72.65,73.37],["the",73.37,73.51],["12th",73.51,74.15],["to",74.15,74.37],["the",74.37,74.53],["15th",74.53,75.51],["century.",75.51,75.51]]},{"start":76.11,"end":78.17,"text":"How did you get interested in that?","words":[["How",76.11,76.67],["did",76.67,76.81],["you",76.81,76.97],["get",76.97,77.13],["interested",77.13,77.65],["in",77.65,77.95],["that?",77.95,78.17]]},{"start":78.89,"end":83.73,"text":"I know there have been some recent articles in the journals about African sculpture.","words":[["I",78.89,79.25],["know",79.25,79.43],["there",79.43,79.63],["have",79.63,79.87],["been",79.87,80.13],["some",80.13,80.35],["recent",80.35,80.63],["articles",80.63,81.19],["in",81.19,81.49],["the",81.49,81.61],["journals",81.61,82.01],["about",82.01,82.57],["African",82.57,83.13],["sculpture.",83.13,83.73]]},{"start":84.21,"end":86.07,"text":"Well, I've read most of those now.","words":[["Well,",84.21,84.47],["I've",84.61,84.85],["read",84.85,85.01],["most",85.01,85.31],["of",85.31,85.53],["those",85.53,85.71],["now.",85.71,86.07]]},{"start":86.61,"end":92.27,"text":"But initially I got my introduction to this at a special display at the City Museum a few years ago.","words":[["But",86.61,86.91],["initially",86.91,87.31],["I",87.31,87.65],["got",87.65,87.77],["my",87.77,87.93],["introduction",87.93,88.35],["to",88.35,88.79],["this",88.79,89.05],["at",89.05,89.35],["a",89.35,89.53],["special",89.53,89.79],["display",89.79,90.29],["at",90.29,90.51],["the",90.51,90.63],["City",90.63,90.85],["Museum",90.85,91.41],["a",91.41,91.57],["few",91.57,91.69],["years",91.69,91.97],["ago.",91.97,92.27]]},{"start":92.27,"end":96.55,"text":"I just happened to be there and saw these works and saw they were fantastic.","words":[["I",92.27,93.07],["just",93.07,93.23],["happened",93.23,93.57],["to",93.57,93.83],["be",93.83,93.97],["there",93.97,94.21],["and",94.21,94.39],["saw",94.39,94.63],["these",94.63,94.85],["works",94.85,95.19],["and",95.19,95.59],["saw",95.59,95.81],["they",95.81,95.97],["were",95.97,96.11],["fantastic.",96.11,96.55]]},{"start":97.39,"end":101.25,"text":"And I even went to Nigeria last summer to see more of them.","words":[["And",97.39,98.07],["I",98.07,98.65],["even",98.65,98.87],["went",98.87,99.07],["to",99.07,99.25],["Nigeria",99.25,99.59],["last",99.59,100.07],["summer",100.07,100.37],["to",100.37,100.53],["see",100.53,100.71],["more",100.71,100.93],["of",100.93,101.07],["them.",101.07,101.25]]},{"start":101.75,"end":107.63,"text":"I've seen the photos for your presentation and I must say the sculptures are gorgeous","words":[["I've",101.75,102.25],["seen",102.25,102.49],["the",102.49,102.69],["photos",102.69,103.09],["for",103.09,103.49],["your",103.49,103.63],["presentation",103.63,104.31],["and",104.31,104.75],["I",104.75,104.99],["must",104.99,105.27],["say",105.27,105.75],["the",105.75,106.05],["sculptures",106.05,106.55],["are",106.55,106.99],["gorgeous",106.99,107.63]]},{"start":107.63,"end":111.03,"text":"portrayals of what appear to be kings and queens.","words":[["portrayals",107.63,108.53],["of",108.53,108.89],["what",108.89,109.11],["appear",109.11,109.55],["to",109.55,109.77],["be",109.77,110.03],["kings",110.03,110.37],["and",110.37,110.69],["queens.",110.69,111.03]]},{"start":111.55,"end":111.81,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",111.55,111.81]]},{"start":112.37,"end":115.71,"text":"I decided to concentrate on those as they're the most typical.","words":[["I",112.37,112.59],["decided",112.59,113.07],["to",113.07,113.27],["concentrate",113.27,113.67],["on",113.67,114.03],["those",114.03,114.37],["as",114.37,114.71],["they're",114.71,114.99],["the",114.99,115.07],["most",115.07,115.27],["typical.",115.27,115.71]]},{"start":116.41,"end":119.11,"text":"They're interesting because they're so naturalistic.","words":[["They're",116.41,116.69],["interesting",116.69,117.15],["because",117.15,117.57],["they're",117.57,117.93],["so",117.93,118.13],["naturalistic.",118.13,119.11]]},{"start":119.11,"end":124.73,"text":"unlike the abstract figures we often associate with African art there's also a","words":[["unlike",119.11,120.11],["the",120.11,120.51],["abstract",120.51,120.87],["figures",120.87,121.35],["we",121.35,121.59],["often",121.59,121.83],["associate",121.83,122.39],["with",122.39,122.67],["African",122.67,122.97],["art",122.97,123.39],["there's",123.39,124.33],["also",124.33,124.57],["a",124.57,124.73]]},{"start":124.73,"end":130.17,"text":"lovely sculpture of a mudfish and one of the scaly crocodile but I didn't get","words":[["lovely",124.73,124.91],["sculpture",124.91,125.41],["of",125.41,125.77],["a",125.77,125.89],["mudfish",125.89,126.43],["and",126.43,127.27],["one",127.27,127.51],["of",127.51,127.67],["the",127.67,127.81],["scaly",127.81,128.17],["crocodile",128.17,128.65],["but",128.65,129.57],["I",129.57,129.79],["didn't",129.79,130.03],["get",130.03,130.17]]},{"start":130.17,"end":135.55,"text":"very good pictures of those so I won't spend long on them right so what was the","words":[["very",130.17,130.39],["good",130.39,130.57],["pictures",130.57,131.01],["of",131.01,131.23],["those",131.23,131.49],["so",131.49,131.95],["I",131.95,132.15],["won't",132.15,132.33],["spend",132.33,132.51],["long",132.51,132.79],["on",132.79,132.95],["them",132.95,133.15],["right",133.15,133.69],["so",133.69,134.83],["what",134.83,135.17],["was",135.17,135.39],["the",135.39,135.55]]},{"start":135.55,"end":141.17,"text":"city of if a like when these works were made it's on the Niger River isn't it","words":[["city",135.55,135.93],["of",135.93,136.23],["if",136.23,136.51],["a",136.51,136.67],["like",136.67,137.03],["when",137.03,137.39],["these",137.39,137.67],["works",137.67,138.03],["were",138.03,138.29],["made",138.29,138.81],["it's",138.81,139.61],["on",139.61,139.79],["the",139.79,139.89],["Niger",139.89,140.11],["River",140.11,140.53],["isn't",140.53,140.83],["it",140.83,141.17]]},{"start":141.17,"end":146.31,"text":"yeah the boat traffic's what made it a center of commerce then as it still is","words":[["yeah",141.17,141.59],["the",141.59,142.51],["boat",142.51,142.71],["traffic's",142.71,143.45],["what",143.45,143.69],["made",143.69,143.93],["it",143.93,144.05],["a",144.05,144.17],["center",144.17,144.43],["of",144.43,144.61],["commerce",144.61,144.93],["then",144.93,145.37],["as",145.37,145.77],["it",145.77,145.89],["still",145.89,146.13],["is",146.13,146.31]]},{"start":146.31,"end":150.37,"text":"today, but nowadays it's better known as the home of a big university.","words":[["today,",146.31,146.55],["but",147.17,147.35],["nowadays",147.35,147.75],["it's",147.75,148.15],["better",148.15,148.39],["known",148.39,148.65],["as",148.65,148.87],["the",148.87,148.97],["home",148.97,149.27],["of",149.27,149.39],["a",149.39,149.51],["big",149.51,149.65],["university.",149.65,150.37]]},{"start":150.93,"end":153.89,"text":"Speaking of modern day, Ife, tell me about your trip.","words":[["Speaking",150.93,151.33],["of",151.33,151.65],["modern",151.65,151.89],["day,",151.89,152.21],["Ife,",152.35,152.63],["tell",152.79,152.99],["me",152.99,153.13],["about",153.13,153.33],["your",153.33,153.55],["trip.",153.55,153.89]]},{"start":154.29,"end":158.51,"text":"I was incredibly lucky to be able to get enough money to go.","words":[["I",154.29,154.59],["was",154.59,155.71],["incredibly",155.71,156.25],["lucky",156.25,156.69],["to",156.69,156.91],["be",156.91,157.05],["able",157.05,157.21],["to",157.21,157.35],["get",157.35,157.49],["enough",157.49,157.71],["money",157.71,158.05],["to",158.05,158.23],["go.",158.23,158.51]]},{"start":159.03,"end":162.41,"text":"My parents encouraged me, but they couldn't afford to send me.","words":[["My",159.03,159.21],["parents",159.21,159.55],["encouraged",159.55,160.03],["me,",160.03,160.39],["but",160.79,160.97],["they",160.97,161.15],["couldn't",161.15,161.37],["afford",161.37,161.59],["to",161.59,161.81],["send",161.81,162.13],["me.",162.13,162.41]]},{"start":162.95,"end":166.87,"text":"I applied for a grant from the Arts Council, and in the end I got it.","words":[["I",162.95,163.39],["applied",163.39,163.65],["for",163.65,163.91],["a",163.91,164.01],["grant",164.01,164.37],["from",164.37,164.57],["the",164.57,164.73],["Arts",164.73,164.97],["Council,",164.97,165.25],["and",165.25,165.91],["in",165.91,166.01],["the",166.01,166.13],["end",166.13,166.31],["I",166.31,166.47],["got",166.47,166.63],["it.",166.63,166.87]]},{"start":167.35,"end":172.23,"text":"I also wrote a series of articles about my trip for the local newspaper, but I didn't","words":[["I",167.35,167.63],["also",167.63,167.87],["wrote",167.87,168.09],["a",168.09,168.25],["series",168.25,168.45],["of",168.45,168.69],["articles",168.69,169.01],["about",169.01,169.41],["my",169.41,169.61],["trip",169.61,169.89],["for",169.89,170.05],["the",170.05,170.13],["local",170.13,170.37],["newspaper,",170.37,170.89],["but",171.43,171.79],["I",171.79,172.01],["didn't",172.01,172.23]]},{"start":172.23,"end":173.27,"text":"get any money for that.","words":[["get",172.23,172.37],["any",172.37,172.61],["money",172.61,172.87],["for",172.87,173.07],["that.",173.07,173.27]]},{"start":173.67,"end":175.33,"text":"I was just pleased to get them published.","words":[["I",173.67,173.97],["was",173.97,174.09],["just",174.09,174.25],["pleased",174.25,174.53],["to",174.53,174.75],["get",174.75,174.83],["them",174.83,174.97],["published.",174.97,175.33]]},{"start":175.33,"end":177.35,"text":"And the highlight of the trip?","words":[["And",175.33,176.13],["the",176.13,176.37],["highlight",176.37,176.71],["of",176.71,176.99],["the",176.99,177.11],["trip?",177.11,177.35]]},{"start":178.13,"end":181.67,"text":"That had to be meeting a professor working on the site in Ife,","words":[["That",178.13,178.27],["had",178.27,178.45],["to",178.45,178.59],["be",178.59,178.73],["meeting",178.73,179.01],["a",179.01,179.23],["professor",179.23,179.69],["working",179.69,180.49],["on",180.49,180.77],["the",180.77,180.87],["site",180.87,181.19],["in",181.19,181.37],["Ife,",181.37,181.67]]},{"start":181.89,"end":185.35,"text":"who had been a young boy when they first discovered the sculptures by accident","words":[["who",181.89,182.05],["had",182.05,182.19],["been",182.19,182.37],["a",182.37,182.51],["young",182.51,182.73],["boy",182.73,183.01],["when",183.01,183.21],["they",183.21,183.39],["first",183.39,183.61],["discovered",183.61,184.05],["the",184.05,184.25],["sculptures",184.25,184.53],["by",184.53,184.89],["accident",184.89,185.35]]},{"start":185.35,"end":187.85,"text":"at a building site in 1938.","words":[["at",185.35,185.99],["a",185.99,186.11],["building",186.11,186.33],["site",186.33,186.75],["in",186.75,186.99],["1938.",186.99,187.85]]},{"start":188.81,"end":190.49,"text":"He had been working at the site.","words":[["He",188.81,189.13],["had",189.13,189.35],["been",189.35,189.51],["working",189.51,189.87],["at",189.87,190.07],["the",190.07,190.17],["site.",190.17,190.49]]},{"start":191.31,"end":195.41,"text":"Of course, I also got to talk to lots of artists who were working there today","words":[["Of",191.31,191.49],["course,",191.49,191.67],["I",192.09,192.29],["also",192.29,192.51],["got",192.51,192.73],["to",192.73,192.91],["talk",192.91,193.09],["to",193.09,193.23],["lots",193.23,193.41],["of",193.41,193.61],["artists",193.61,194.07],["who",194.07,194.37],["were",194.37,194.47],["working",194.47,194.75],["there",194.75,195.01],["today",195.01,195.41]]},{"start":195.41,"end":199.01,"text":"and I got to try my hand at making a little sculpture myself.","words":[["and",195.41,196.29],["I",196.29,196.47],["got",196.47,196.57],["to",196.57,196.73],["try",196.73,196.91],["my",196.91,197.09],["hand",197.09,197.37],["at",197.37,197.51],["making",197.51,197.73],["a",197.73,197.97],["little",197.97,198.15],["sculpture",198.15,198.59],["myself.",198.59,199.01]]},{"start":202.66,"end":204.9,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion,","words":[["Before",202.66,203.12],["you",203.12,203.4],["hear",203.4,203.68],["the",203.68,203.92],["rest",203.92,204.2],["of",204.2,204.36],["the",204.36,204.42],["discussion,",204.42,204.9]]},{"start":246.59,"end":251.55,"text":"Well, let's see what you might do to improve what you're planning for your presentation.","words":[["Well,",246.59,247.15],["let's",247.35,247.67],["see",247.67,247.83],["what",247.83,248.03],["you",248.03,248.27],["might",248.27,248.47],["do",248.47,248.73],["to",248.73,248.91],["improve",248.91,249.45],["what",249.45,249.83],["you're",249.83,250.19],["planning",250.19,250.49],["for",250.49,250.77],["your",250.77,250.93],["presentation.",250.93,251.55]]},{"start":252.37,"end":257.49,"text":"About the sculptures themselves, I think I need to add as much as possible about the","words":[["About",252.37,252.69],["the",252.69,252.93],["sculptures",252.93,253.27],["themselves,",253.27,254.01],["I",254.85,255.07],["think",255.07,255.23],["I",255.23,255.43],["need",255.43,255.55],["to",255.55,255.75],["add",255.75,255.93],["as",255.93,256.03],["much",256.03,256.33],["as",256.33,256.49],["possible",256.49,256.97],["about",256.97,257.29],["the",257.29,257.49]]},{"start":257.49,"end":262.93,"text":"details of the way they were made. Of course, I can't add anything about the artists who","words":[["details",257.49,257.93],["of",257.93,258.17],["the",258.17,258.29],["way",258.29,258.45],["they",258.45,258.61],["were",258.61,258.75],["made.",258.75,259.09],["Of",259.85,260.01],["course,",260.01,260.25],["I",260.63,260.85],["can't",260.85,261.15],["add",261.15,261.27],["anything",261.27,261.61],["about",261.61,261.89],["the",261.89,262.05],["artists",262.05,262.57],["who",262.57,262.93]]},{"start":262.93,"end":266.23,"text":"made them, because nobody really knows anything about them.","words":[["made",262.93,263.17],["them,",263.17,263.51],["because",263.79,264.21],["nobody",264.21,264.65],["really",264.65,265.01],["knows",265.01,265.31],["anything",265.31,265.59],["about",265.59,265.93],["them.",265.93,266.23]]},{"start":266.23,"end":271.89,"text":"All good points, and you've certainly said enough about what the sculptures depict,","words":[["All",266.23,266.91],["good",266.91,267.25],["points,",267.25,267.73],["and",268.05,268.57],["you've",268.57,268.97],["certainly",268.97,269.31],["said",269.31,269.61],["enough",269.61,270.01],["about",270.01,270.33],["what",270.33,270.63],["the",270.63,270.83],["sculptures",270.83,271.21],["depict,",271.21,271.89]]},{"start":272.51,"end":281.13,"text":"what the subjects are, that's well covered, but I'd make some bigger photos of them so you can clearly see the fine detail.","words":[["what",272.51,272.83],["the",272.83,273.01],["subjects",273.01,273.49],["are,",273.49,274.05],["that's",274.35,274.81],["well",274.81,274.99],["covered,",274.99,275.55],["but",275.99,276.19],["I'd",276.19,276.81],["make",276.81,276.95],["some",276.95,277.17],["bigger",277.17,277.53],["photos",277.53,278.03],["of",278.03,278.49],["them",278.49,278.75],["so",278.75,279.07],["you",279.07,279.25],["can",279.25,279.43],["clearly",279.43,279.75],["see",279.75,280.09],["the",280.09,280.27],["fine",280.27,280.57],["detail.",280.57,281.13]]},{"start":281.47,"end":281.75,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",281.47,281.75]]},{"start":282.57,"end":289.75,"text":"And I would limit my personal reactions to these works of art if I were you. I know you think they're fantastic.","words":[["And",282.57,283.01],["I",283.01,283.29],["would",283.29,283.47],["limit",283.47,283.91],["my",283.91,284.19],["personal",284.19,284.81],["reactions",284.81,285.33],["to",285.33,285.71],["these",285.71,285.93],["works",285.93,286.23],["of",286.23,286.47],["art",286.47,286.69],["if",286.69,286.87],["I",286.87,287.03],["were",287.03,287.19],["you.",287.19,287.45],["I",287.93,288.21],["know",288.21,288.55],["you",288.55,288.81],["think",288.81,289.05],["they're",289.05,289.31],["fantastic.",289.31,289.75]]},{"start":290.33,"end":293.23,"text":"You're right. I'll contain my enthusiasm.","words":[["You're",290.33,290.95],["right.",290.95,291.19],["I'll",291.57,291.91],["contain",291.91,292.31],["my",292.31,292.63],["enthusiasm.",292.63,293.23]]},{"start":294.27,"end":298.03,"text":"What about the section of the presentation which I call history?","words":[["What",294.27,294.89],["about",294.89,295.11],["the",295.11,295.31],["section",295.31,295.65],["of",295.65,295.87],["the",295.87,295.99],["presentation",295.99,296.47],["which",296.47,296.99],["I",296.99,297.21],["call",297.21,297.49],["history?",297.49,298.03]]},{"start":298.79,"end":305.13,"text":"I'd like to go into more depth about the history of that whole area, you know, in the countries around Nigeria.","words":[["I'd",298.79,299.41],["like",299.41,299.55],["to",299.55,299.71],["go",299.71,299.87],["into",299.87,300.09],["more",300.09,300.35],["depth",300.35,300.67],["about",300.67,300.99],["the",300.99,301.15],["history",301.15,301.47],["of",301.47,301.71],["that",301.71,301.89],["whole",301.89,302.15],["area,",302.15,302.61],["you",302.75,302.87],["know,",302.87,303.03],["in",303.37,303.65],["the",303.65,303.75],["countries",303.75,304.09],["around",304.09,304.53],["Nigeria.",304.53,305.13]]},{"start":305.69,"end":308.11,"text":"That would make the presentation stronger.","words":[["That",305.69,306.09],["would",306.09,306.31],["make",306.31,306.59],["the",306.59,306.77],["presentation",306.77,307.39],["stronger.",307.39,308.11]]},{"start":308.77,"end":313.95,"text":"But I think you've covered the situation regarding the rulers of the country quite well,","words":[["But",308.77,309.05],["I",309.05,309.31],["think",309.31,309.53],["you've",309.53,309.85],["covered",309.85,310.27],["the",310.27,310.47],["situation",310.47,311.11],["regarding",311.11,311.65],["the",311.65,312.09],["rulers",312.09,312.47],["of",312.47,312.73],["the",312.73,312.85],["country",312.85,313.21],["quite",313.21,313.49],["well,",313.49,313.95]]},{"start":314.21,"end":321.45,"text":"and you've got plenty already about what the Ife people were doing then and the way their society was structured.","words":[["and",314.21,314.75],["you've",314.75,315.21],["got",315.21,315.33],["plenty",315.33,315.71],["already",315.71,316.23],["about",316.23,316.65],["what",316.65,316.95],["the",316.95,317.15],["Ife",317.15,317.47],["people",317.47,317.87],["were",317.87,318.09],["doing",318.09,318.39],["then",318.39,318.79],["and",318.79,319.51],["the",319.51,319.71],["way",319.71,319.85],["their",319.85,320.11],["society",320.11,320.59],["was",320.59,320.87],["structured.",320.87,321.45]]},{"start":321.45,"end":328.17,"text":"And in fact, I think you could cut out the bit about modern Nigerian history because it's not relevant.","words":[["And",321.45,322.45],["in",322.45,322.65],["fact,",322.65,322.95],["I",323.03,323.33],["think",323.33,323.61],["you",323.61,323.79],["could",323.79,323.95],["cut",323.95,324.31],["out",324.31,324.57],["the",324.57,324.77],["bit",324.77,324.97],["about",324.97,325.27],["modern",325.27,325.75],["Nigerian",325.75,326.41],["history",326.41,326.73],["because",326.73,327.09],["it's",327.09,327.45],["not",327.45,327.65],["relevant.",327.65,328.17]]},{"start":328.55,"end":334.23,"text":"I agree. That doesn't fit. But perhaps I should concentrate more on the religious beliefs,","words":[["I",328.55,328.85],["agree.",328.85,329.17],["That",329.51,329.59],["doesn't",329.59,329.89],["fit.",329.89,330.15],["But",330.75,331.35],["perhaps",331.35,331.67],["I",331.67,331.89],["should",331.89,331.99],["concentrate",331.99,332.49],["more",332.49,332.93],["on",332.93,333.19],["the",333.19,333.31],["religious",333.31,333.67],["beliefs,",333.67,334.23]]},{"start":334.61,"end":338.71,"text":"since all these sculptures do seem to have some kind of religious association.","words":[["since",334.61,334.91],["all",334.91,335.29],["these",335.29,335.47],["sculptures",335.47,335.87],["do",335.87,336.25],["seem",336.25,336.51],["to",336.51,336.65],["have",336.65,336.89],["some",336.89,337.21],["kind",337.21,337.45],["of",337.45,337.61],["religious",337.61,337.89],["association.",337.89,338.71]]},{"start":339.23,"end":341.41,"text":"Good. I can lend you a book on that.","words":[["Good.",339.23,339.51],["I",339.89,340.11],["can",340.11,340.29],["lend",340.29,340.45],["you",340.45,340.65],["a",340.65,340.75],["book",340.75,340.95],["on",340.95,341.17],["that.",341.17,341.41]]},{"start":342.45,"end":349.15,"text":"Now, probably the part the class will find most interesting is the report of your trip to Nigeria","words":[["Now,",342.45,342.87],["probably",342.97,343.37],["the",343.37,343.65],["part",343.65,343.89],["the",343.89,344.09],["class",344.09,344.53],["will",344.53,344.87],["find",344.87,345.21],["most",345.21,345.63],["interesting",345.63,346.29],["is",346.29,346.89],["the",346.89,347.07],["report",347.07,347.41],["of",347.41,347.67],["your",347.67,347.85],["trip",347.85,348.23],["to",348.23,348.49],["Nigeria",348.49,349.15]]},{"start":349.15,"end":354.33,"text":"and the research you did there. So I gather you managed to use the University","words":[["and",349.15,349.91],["the",349.91,350.11],["research",350.11,350.51],["you",350.51,350.75],["did",350.75,350.95],["there.",350.95,351.25],["So",351.87,352.17],["I",352.17,352.43],["gather",352.43,352.67],["you",352.67,352.87],["managed",352.87,353.15],["to",353.15,353.43],["use",353.43,353.63],["the",353.63,353.83],["University",353.83,354.33]]},{"start":354.33,"end":359.77,"text":"Library in Ife. Yes. As soon as I'd explained why I wanted the information,","words":[["Library",354.33,354.95],["in",354.95,355.19],["Ife.",355.19,355.47],["Yes.",355.81,356.19],["As",356.95,357.19],["soon",357.19,357.43],["as",357.43,357.55],["I'd",357.55,357.73],["explained",357.73,358.09],["why",358.09,358.47],["I",358.47,358.65],["wanted",358.65,358.93],["the",358.93,359.13],["information,",359.13,359.77]]},{"start":360.19,"end":364.49,"text":"that was no problem. They couldn't have been more helpful. There were some","words":[["that",360.19,360.31],["was",360.31,360.43],["no",360.43,360.59],["problem.",360.59,360.97],["They",361.57,361.85],["couldn't",361.85,362.07],["have",362.07,362.17],["been",362.17,362.37],["more",362.37,362.61],["helpful.",362.61,363.03],["There",363.75,364.11],["were",364.11,364.23],["some",364.23,364.49]]},{"start":364.49,"end":368.67,"text":"interesting accounts of how the first sculptures were found and what happened","words":[["interesting",364.49,365.09],["accounts",365.09,365.63],["of",365.63,365.87],["how",365.87,366.01],["the",366.01,366.17],["first",366.17,366.41],["sculptures",366.41,366.81],["were",366.81,367.11],["found",367.11,367.49],["and",367.49,368.15],["what",368.15,368.33],["happened",368.33,368.67]]},{"start":368.67,"end":373.81,"text":"to them, which I want to include. What struck me when I saw the sculptures in","words":[["to",368.67,368.91],["them,",368.91,369.09],["which",369.29,369.53],["I",369.53,369.67],["want",369.67,369.81],["to",369.81,369.95],["include.",369.95,370.31],["What",371.29,371.77],["struck",371.77,372.11],["me",372.11,372.41],["when",372.41,372.59],["I",372.59,372.69],["saw",372.69,372.97],["the",372.97,373.13],["sculptures",373.13,373.55],["in",373.55,373.81]]},{"start":373.81,"end":378.37,"text":"Nigeria is the extent to which 20th century European artists were","words":[["Nigeria",373.81,374.35],["is",374.35,374.99],["the",374.99,375.19],["extent",375.19,375.57],["to",375.57,375.83],["which",375.83,375.99],["20th",375.99,376.57],["century",376.57,376.91],["European",376.91,377.35],["artists",377.35,378.09],["were",378.09,378.37]]},{"start":378.37,"end":382.75,"text":"influenced by them. But that's beyond the scope of my presentation, I think.","words":[["influenced",378.37,378.79],["by",378.79,379.15],["them.",379.15,379.37],["But",379.91,380.23],["that's",380.23,380.69],["beyond",380.69,380.93],["the",380.93,381.13],["scope",381.13,381.37],["of",381.37,381.55],["my",381.55,381.71],["presentation,",381.71,382.25],["I",382.49,382.57],["think.",382.57,382.75]]},{"start":383.25,"end":389.39,"text":"Yes. What about the sources of the materials they used? You don't mention that anywhere.","words":[["Yes.",383.25,383.61],["What",384.23,384.75],["about",384.75,384.97],["the",384.97,385.21],["sources",385.21,385.77],["of",385.77,386.17],["the",386.17,386.29],["materials",386.29,386.81],["they",386.81,387.11],["used?",387.11,387.55],["You",387.99,388.29],["don't",388.29,388.59],["mention",388.59,388.89],["that",388.89,389.09],["anywhere.",389.09,389.39]]},{"start":389.99,"end":395.43,"text":"I didn't manage to find out much about that. I want to cover the theories about who the","words":[["I",389.99,390.33],["didn't",390.33,390.59],["manage",390.59,390.85],["to",390.85,391.05],["find",391.05,391.25],["out",391.25,391.45],["much",391.45,391.69],["about",391.69,391.97],["that.",391.97,392.37],["I",393.15,393.49],["want",393.49,393.59],["to",393.59,393.75],["cover",393.75,393.97],["the",393.97,394.11],["theories",394.11,394.59],["about",394.59,394.91],["who",394.91,395.25],["the",395.25,395.43]]},{"start":395.43,"end":399.67,"text":"original sculptors were, though. Yes, the idea that a lot of them may have","words":[["original",395.43,395.79],["sculptors",395.79,396.41],["were,",396.41,396.67],["though.",396.77,396.89],["Yes,",397.27,397.59],["the",397.75,397.87],["idea",397.87,398.35],["that",398.35,398.63],["a",398.63,398.81],["lot",398.81,399.01],["of",399.01,399.21],["them",399.21,399.33],["may",399.33,399.57],["have",399.57,399.67]]},{"start":399.67,"end":402.61,"text":"been made by the same person. That's very interesting.","words":[["been",399.67,399.85],["made",399.85,400.11],["by",400.11,400.33],["the",400.33,400.51],["same",400.51,400.77],["person.",400.77,401.25],["That's",401.61,401.89],["very",401.89,402.07],["interesting.",402.07,402.61]]},{"start":402.97,"end":406.27,"text":"It is, isn't it? Right. Well, thanks for all the advice.","words":[["It",402.97,403.13],["is,",403.13,403.29],["isn't",403.35,403.51],["it?",403.51,403.71],["Right.",404.39,404.73],["Well,",404.89,405.03],["thanks",405.23,405.47],["for",405.47,405.69],["all",405.69,405.77],["the",405.77,405.87],["advice.",405.87,406.27]]},{"start":411.14,"end":413.3,"text":"That is the end of Part 3.","words":[["That",411.14,411.78],["is",411.78,411.9],["the",411.9,412.08],["end",412.08,412.54],["of",412.54,412.7],["Part",412.7,412.92],["3.",412.92,413.3]]},{"start":414.2,"end":418.28,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["You",414.2,414.42],["now",414.42,414.7],["have",414.7,415.1],["30",415.1,415.56],["seconds",415.56,416.02],["to",416.02,416.36],["check",416.36,416.64],["your",416.64,416.88],["answers",416.88,417.3],["to",417.3,417.62],["Part",417.62,417.84],["3.",417.84,418.28]]}]}